### Get unknown moderation case

GET {{baseUrl}}/cases/{{missingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("server")}}

###

### Get notes for unknown moderation case

GET {{baseUrl}}/cases/{{missingId}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("server")}}

###

### Get evidence for unknown moderation case

GET {{baseUrl}}/cases/{{missingId}}/evidence
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("server")}}

###

### Add empty case note

POST {{baseUrl}}/cases/{{caseId}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{actorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "   "
}

###

### Add empty case evidence

POST {{baseUrl}}/cases/{{caseId}}/evidence
Authorization: Bearer {{actorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "CHAT_LOG",
  "value": "   "
}

###

### Get unknown report

GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/{{missingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$auth.token("server")}}